        "raw": "[name=\"Texas\"]   Hmph.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Texas",
        "content": "Hmph."
    },
    {
        "id": 184,
        "raw": "[name=\"Texas\"]   We can't give Reunion time to regroup.",
